[[collapsible hideLocation="both" show="+ Command Help" hide="- Hide Help"]]

: {{ls}} : Lists the contents of the current directory. With {{-a}}, also lists hidden files and folders (those with names starting with a '.').

: {{cd}} : Changes the current directory. ".." refers to the parent directory - the folder containing the current one.

: {{rm}} : Deletes a file. {{-r}} to delete recursively, {{-d}} to also delete directories.

: {{man}} : Displays the help page for a command.

: {{gpg}} : Gnu Privacy Guard, an implementation of the PGP encryption standard. With {{@@--@@unlock}}, unlock the default keyring in order to enable decrypting files or messages. Use with {{-d}} to actually decrypt a file.

: {{cat}} : Displays a file's contents as raw text.

: {{display}} : Displays an image in the terminal.

: {{fbpdf}} : Displays the contents of a pdf document.

